---
import SectionHeader from "@/common/components/astroComponentes/SectionHeader.astro";
import { Mail, Send } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section
	id="contacto"
	class="sm:mx-auto mx-4 max-w-[32rem] py-8 sm:py-10 transition-all md:max-w-[42rem] lg:max-w-4xl"
>
	<div
		class="relative flex flex-col items-center gap-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-300/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100 via-sky-200 to-blue-300 px-4 py-8 shadow-md shadow-blue-300/30 transition-[border-color,box-shadow] duration-300 hover:border-slate-400/90 dark:border-white/15 dark:from-[#172554] dark:via-[#1e3a8a] dark:to-[#111827] dark:shadow-black/30 dark:hover:border-white/40 md:px-4 md:py-12
		       before:absolute before:top-0 before:left-0 before:w-full
		       before:h-full before:content-[''] before:opacity-[0.03] before:z-10 before:pointer-events-none
		       before:bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg_viewBox=%220_0_200_200%22_xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter_id=%22noiseFilter%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence_type=%22fractalNoise%22_baseFrequency=%220.8%22_numOctaves=%223%22_stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect_width=%22100%25%22_height=%22100%25%22_filter=%22url(%23noiseFilter)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E')]"
		data-reveal-item
		style="--motion-delay: 40ms; --motion-duration: var(--motion-duration-base); --motion-distance: 18px; --motion-blur: 4px;"
	>
		<div class="space-y-4">
			<SectionHeader title="Creemos algo juntos" center>
				<Send slot="icon" class="h-8 w-8 text-slate-900 dark:text-sky-300" />
			</SectionHeader>

			<p
				class="max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-300 md:text-base"
			>
				Abierto a nuevas oportunidades, colaboraciones freelance o simplemente
				para charlar sobre diseño, desarrollo y procesos creativos. Si tenés un
				proyecto en mente o querés conectar, este es un buen momento para
				hacerlo.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 items-center">
			<a
				href="mailto:matiasowjordan@gmail.com"
				target="_blank"
				class="gap-2 text-base inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2.5 font-semibold text-center rounded-lg transition-all duration-200
				       bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white border border-slate-800
				       dark:bg-gray-900 dark:hover:bg-gray-950 dark:border-gray-700
				       shadow-md shadow-slate-900/25 dark:shadow-black/30
				       focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white dark:focus-visible:ring-sky-500"
			>
				<Mail class="h-4 w-4" />
				Enviar correo
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
